      "one_line": "Cuchulan — wary clan confederation of the forest; honor, glory.",
      "one_paragraph": "The Cuchulan (Celtic) are a assertive clan confederation people seeded in forest, dense forest, hills. They prize honor, glory, hospitality, lean toward the military sphere, and field light_infantry, chariots, berserkers. Outsiders are met as wary; their patrons touch war, nature, death."
